        "field": "p1",
        "part_key": null,
        "part_keys": [],
        "display": {
          "state": "value",
          "value": "The world of Laser Powder-bed Fusion (L-PBF) has been tightly held within the clutches of proprietary practices, limiting innovation and knowledge sharing. This project was born out of a desire to challenge this exclusivity by creating an open-source infrastructure for L-PBF. The aim was to democratize access to this advanced manufacturing process, stimulate innovation, and foster cross-disciplinary collaboration. Despite the complex and professional nature of L-PBF, which involves dealing with high-power lasers, explosive metal powders, and specialized equipment, the project's commitment to open-source principles remained unwavering."
        },
